{"id":"reincarnated-as-a-sword-tmdb-134667","type":"SERIES","category":"STREAMING","title":"Reincarnated as a Sword","overview":"Tras morir en un accidente automovilístico, un hombre despierta en otro mundo reencarnado no como un héroe o un mago, sino como una espada inteligente clavada en un altar. Poseyendo habilidades de absorción de poderes, la espada espera pacientemente a que alguien digno la empuñe.\n\nSu destino cambia cuando conoce a Fran, una niña de la raza de los Gatos Negros que huye de una vida de esclavitud tras un ataque de monstruos. Fran empuña la espada, a la que nombra Maestro, y juntos forman un vínculo inquebrantable. Mientras Fran busca evolucionar a su raza —algo que se cree imposible—, Maestro se compromete a ser su fuerza, protegiéndola en un mundo hostil lleno de aventureros, bestias y prejuicios raciales.","releaseDate":"2026-10-08","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Avn1pnxeDznpJStZFq4jOxPM4Ek.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fo5qwDAVqY7j2jmL350WKjk6kmi.jpg","genres":["Animación","Comedia","Sci-Fi & Fantasy"],"originalLanguage":"ja","spokenLanguages":["Japanese"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/fo5qwDAVqY7j2jmL350WKjk6kmi.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/zFNwsiUiYiV3AyIT28E5x7fwnzW.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/5ULZIfD5CcH3F2QS0IaWPMiVM6i.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/xlWgctM8Ybfyyi2rWhysmqVbmnx.jpg","label":"Escena 04"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":7.3},"availability":{"platforms":["Netflix","Netflix Standard with Ads"],"networks":["TOKYO MX"]},"saga":{"name":"Reincarnated as a Sword","items":[{"title":"Temporada 1","year":"2022","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvWXxUHi4a2VzEyDS9B88dEeOJZ.jpg","overview":"La primera temporada narra el encuentro entre Maestro y Fran y sus primeros pasos como aventureros. Juntos llegan a la ciudad de Alessa, donde Fran debe demostrar su valía frente a otros aventureros que la subestiman por su edad y su raza. La trama se centra en el crecimiento de Fran, quien pasa de ser una esclava temerosa a una guerrera formidable, culminando en la peligrosa exploración de una mazmorra donde se enfrentarán a la corrupción y a enemigos que pondrán a prueba su sincronización.","rating":7.3,"extra":"12 episodios"},{"title":"Temporada 2","year":"2026","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6XllUytvCgpwDHcCVcrA0iJfSYB.jpg","extra":"12 episodios"}]},"cast":[{"name":"Miki Shin'ichirou","role":"Master (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yL9Tx2HZgK7t5AssYl6oGE9bjdj.jpg","personTmdbId":62318,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":24},{"name":"Ai Kakuma","role":"Fran (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3tQSeeJAeafJNvQs2IKvpKY7av.jpg","personTmdbId":1324646,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":24},{"name":"小清水亜美","role":"Amanda (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e5sU0stGjTMtFoj0jjHH7OFUqYC.jpg","personTmdbId":1220947,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":24},{"name":"羽多野渉","role":"Klimt (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1meHlOXLP2ubJZkmyGJONrxikQ.jpg","personTmdbId":221772,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":24},{"name":"稲田徹","role":"Donadrond (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hN6WVTxPAd4Jbc9iqWwoWFthT6p.jpg","personTmdbId":126704,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":24},{"name":"大久保瑠美","role":"Nell (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf4cnFMllu1yO3X0gCGGDdl8GXW.jpg","personTmdbId":1256913,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":24},{"name":"辻親八","role":"Garrus (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/af5ILJbixauO84bsuLOr8XSU9yd.jpg","personTmdbId":65438,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":24},{"name":"藤井ゆきよ","role":"Announcement-san (voice)","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLG4K1iix3QNHFexf98mrZ25jT6.jpg","personTmdbId":1287794,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":11},{"name":"佐藤恵","role":"Lala (voic